+The algorithm proceeds in four sequential steps [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial]:
 
-1.  **Spatial Partitioning:** Divide the space containing the tetrahedral datasets into a list of blocks along the viewing direction, with every block containing a subset of tetrahedra [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial].
-2.  **Parallel Sorting (Layer Peeling):** Sort tetrahedra accurately by peeling tetrahedral subsets into unobstructed layers in parallel [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial].
